WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:05.300
We've all been there before: sitting in a
packed theater, staring up at the silver screen,

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.020
scratching our heads wondering where we've
seen a certain actor before.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:15.200
In the case of the actress who stars in the
2019 horror sequel 47 Meters Down: Uncaged,

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.660
she won't catch your eye for any of her previous
work on film or television.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:23.180
Rather, it's down to her family name and how
it's placed her in the public eye from a very

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.200
young age and put her on a path toward stardom.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:32.960
Leading 47 Meters Down: Uncaged, the sequel
to 2017's 47 Meters Down, is Sistine Rose

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:38.760
Stallone, who has a very famous father in
Rocky and Rambo franchise star Sylvester Stallone.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.700
"Seems like lately everybody wants to beat
me up."

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:47.920
The striking 21-year-old makes her feature
film debut in Uncaged, playing a teenage girl

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:52.760
named Nicole who dives into a ruined underwater
city with three of her closest friends.

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:57.239
Much to their horror, the four girls soon
discover that the secret city is home to threats

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:00.580
of all kinds, including the deadliest sharks
known to man.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.840
The younger Stallone has been in the Hollywood
spotlight for a long time, thanks to her easily

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:06.120
recognizable father.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:10.080
Throughout her life, she's appeared alongside
her dear ol' dad at movie premieres, glitzy

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.820
Hollywood outings, and film festivals like
Cannes.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:16.880
So if you feel like you've seen her dirty
blonde hair and brown eyes somewhere before,

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:21.280
it's likely that you saw a snap of Sistine
and Sylvester together on the red carpet.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:26.660
You may have also seen her up on the Golden
Globe Awards stage in 2017 as Miss Golden

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:30.920
Globe, an honor given to up-and-coming children
of prominent Hollywood celebrities.

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:35.100
While Stallone hit the genetic jackpot in
being the daughter of a Hollywood legend and

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:39.830
former model Jennifer Flavin, she isn't solely
relying on her famous family to carve out

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:41.000
a career for herself.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.700
Of course, her conventional good looks and
surname that's instantly linkable to her father

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:51.049
have helped set her up for fame, as evidenced
by her one million-plus followers on Instagram,

00:01:51.049 --> 00:01:54.820
but Stallone worked hard to establish herself
as a model prior to jumping into the acting

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:55.820
world.

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:00.940
"I don't normally wear a red lip, but I love
what they did, and it's kind of faded."

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:06.939
She signed with IMG Models in 2016, and has
walked in Dolce &amp; Gabbana and Chanel fashion

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:07.760
shows.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.000
She's also been on the cover of Town &amp; Country
and Elle Russia.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.500
Ironically enough, while Stallone has said
she's always dreamt of modeling and even loves

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:19.890
it so much that she would work for free, she
once said that she could never picture herself

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:21.060
getting into acting.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:24.320
She told The Hollywood Reporter in January
2017,

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.860
"As for me, I don't think I could ever act.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.260
I'm good for modeling because I don't have
to talk.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.300
[Acting] is something you're born with."

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:35.840
With a mother like Jennifer Flavin, Sistine
Rose was bound to try her hand at modeling,

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:39.319
and with a father like Sylvester Stallone,
how could she not be born with the acting

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.000
gene firmly in place?

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:45.780
She's got the best of both worlds; let's just
hope that her acting chops are as impressive

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:46.780
as her father's.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.540
"He keeps calling my name, 'I want to go home,
Johnny!

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:52.630
I want to drive my Chevy.'

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:54.800
But I couldn't find his f---ing legs!

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.080
I can't find your legs!"

00:02:56.420 --> 00:03:01.980
Catch Sistine Rose Stallone in 47 Meters Down:
Uncaged when the horror film swims into theaters

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:03.240
on August 16.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.540
"Now, off to get some tea!"

